# Local Demo Mode
# ---------------
# Serves the whole UI from an in-memory mock adapter: no Garage server, no S3
# API, no Go backend, no login. Activated with `pnpm demo`, which runs Vite in
# the "demo" mode so this file is loaded.
#
# This flag is only honoured by a development server. `src/lib/consts.ts` gates
# it behind `import.meta.env.DEV`, so a production build evaluates it to false
# at compile time and drops the mock adapter from the bundle entirely.
VITE_DEMO_MODE=true
